General Algorithm

state = observe()
while True:
    future = imagine(state)
    action = choose(future)
    result = execute(action)
    mirror = reconstruct(result)
    operators = hammer(mirror)
    invariant = zpc(operators)
    state = kintsugi(state, invariant)

Notice that execution is what grounds the cycle. Without observation of outcomes, the oscillation risks drifting into internally consistent but untested narratives.

